  action didChange writes dataRevision, editorClosing, editorUntil, stickerClosing, stickerUntil, confirmDelete, popupOpen, todoSheetOpen, error, dragPhase, dragUntil, dragCommitted, ghostX, ghostY, retryToken, retryOperation, pendingMove, pendingMoveRevision, pendingMoveDay
    match changed
